sidR="00434809"><w:t>- Sangeeta Gakhar</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="5068DF3D" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00117DA1" w:rsidRDefault="00117DA1" w:rsidP="00117DA1"/><w:p w14:paraId="62490438" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00117DA1" w:rsidRDefault="00117DA1" w:rsidP="00117DA1"><w:r w:rsidRPr="00434809"><w:rPr><w:highlight w:val="yellow"/></w:rPr><w:t>1 short bio (8–10 lines)</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="0E07682D" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00434809" w:rsidRDefault="00434809" w:rsidP="00434809"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="NormalWeb"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve">Sangeeta Gakhar is a distinguished behavioral strategist and certified career counselor with nearly two decades of experience in human potential development. Her professional foundation </w:t></w:r><w:r><w:lastRenderedPageBreak/><w:t xml:space="preserve">was built within global leaders such as </w:t></w:r><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>HCL, British Telecom, Indigo, and Snapdeal</w:t></w:r><w:r><w:t>, providing her with an insider’s understanding of the competencies required to thrive in the modern economy. This corporate pedigree allows her to bridge the gap between academic choices and real-world professional success.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="4D344C08" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00434809" w:rsidRDefault="00434809" w:rsidP="00434809"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="NormalWeb"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve">Driven by the philosophy of </w:t></w:r><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Clarity before choice</w:t></w:r><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve">, Sangeeta founded </w:t></w:r><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space="preserve">Career </w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellStart"/><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Weaverz</w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellEnd"/><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve"> to move beyond the traditional "marks-based" mindset. As an ICC and Mentoria certified psychometric expert, she fuses scientific data with a deeply empathetic approach to uncover a student’s innate strengths. Her mission is to transform confusion into a strategic roadmap, empowering the next generation to navigate their futures with self-assurance and professional poise.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="2633C91D" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00117DA1" w:rsidRDefault="00117DA1" w:rsidP="00117DA1"/><w:p w14:paraId="2BB71F2D" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00117DA1" w:rsidRDefault="00117DA1" w:rsidP="00117DA1"><w:r><w:t>Photo</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="2B33B952" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00117DA1" w:rsidRDefault="00117DA1" w:rsidP="00117DA1"/><w:p w14:paraId="7A594C90" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00117DA1" w:rsidRDefault="00117DA1" w:rsidP="00117DA1"><w:r><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Segoe UI Emoji" w:hAnsi="Segoe UI Emoji" w:cs="Segoe UI Emoji"/></w:rPr><w:t>✅</w:t></w:r><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve"> SOCIAL PROOF</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="4EDB1EFB" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00117DA1" w:rsidRDefault="00117DA1" w:rsidP="00117DA1"/><w:p w14:paraId="474067F6" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00117DA1" w:rsidRDefault="00117DA1" w:rsidP="00117DA1"><w:r w:rsidRPr="009F5A5E"><w:rPr><w:highlight w:val="yellow"/></w:rPr><w:t>3–5 testimonials (text + name)</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="0CE12DF9" w14:textId="4AAAD37B" w:rsidR="00117DA1" w:rsidRDefault="00117DA1" w:rsidP="00117DA1"><w:r><w:t>OR</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="3359F5F4" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00B761C7" w:rsidRDefault="00B761C7" w:rsidP="00B761C7"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading3"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>The "Clarity Before Choice" Experience</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="1D3D4EB6" w14:textId="417F1880" w:rsidR="00B761C7" w:rsidRDefault="00B761C7" w:rsidP="00B761C7"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="NormalWeb"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve">"Before meeting Sangeeta, we were overwhelmed by the sheer number of career options and the pressure of board marks. Her 'Clarity before choice' approach changed everything. The psychometric analysis was eye-opening, but it was her empathetic counseling that truly helped my son find his direction. He is now pursuing a path that perfectly aligns with his personality." — </w:t></w:r><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Vidhi Maheshwari</w:t></w:r><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>, Parent (Grade 1</w:t></w:r><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>1</w:t></w:r><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space="preserve"> Student)</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="54015104" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00B761C7" w:rsidRDefault="00B761C7" w:rsidP="00B761C7"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading3"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>2. The Corporate Insider Edge</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="518DE96F" w14:textId="72451E70" w:rsidR="00B761C7" w:rsidRDefault="00B761C7" w:rsidP="00B761C7"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="NormalWeb"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>"Sangeet</w:t></w:r><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve"> Mam’s</w:t></w:r><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve"> background with global giants like HCL and Indigo is what sets her apart. She doesn’t just offer academic advice; she prepares you for the professional world. Her sessions on body language and 'Officer-Like Qualities' gave me the poise I needed to clear my interviews with total confidence. She is truly a master of behavioral coaching." — </w:t></w:r><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Rohan Mehta, Engineering Graduate</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="395C6DCE" w14:textId="59826931" w:rsidR="00B761C7" w:rsidRDefault="00B761C7" w:rsidP="00B761C7"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading3"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>3</w:t></w:r><w:r><w:t>. Digital Branding &amp; Profile Building</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="29ED3C19" w14:textId="4381143F" w:rsidR="00B761C7" w:rsidRDefault="00B761C7" w:rsidP="00B761C7"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="NormalWeb"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>"I didn't realize the importance of a professional digital footprint until I worked with Sangeeta.</w:t></w:r><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve"> </w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="gramStart"/><w:r><w:t>Mam .</w: